@startuml
title CancelOrderSaga: technical states of a cancellation

hide empty description

state RETURNING_STOCK
state REFUNDING_PAYMENT
state SUSPENDED #FFF8E1
state COMPLETED #C8E6C9

[*] --> RETURNING_STOCK : C01 cancellation accepted\nsend ReturnStock
RETURNING_STOCK --> REFUNDING_PAYMENT : C02 StockReturned\nsend RefundPayment
REFUNDING_PAYMENT --> COMPLETED : C03 PaymentRefunded
REFUNDING_PAYMENT --> SUSPENDED : C04 PaymentRefundFailed\nC05 review deadline
RETURNING_STOCK --> SUSPENDED : C05 review deadline
SUSPENDED --> REFUNDING_PAYMENT : C06 retry\nsend RefundPayment
SUSPENDED --> RETURNING_STOCK : C06 retry\nsend ReturnStock
COMPLETED --> [*]

note bottom of SUSPENDED
  The answer that was missing is handled
  as in the remembered step.
end note

legend right
  Green: order CANCELED
  Yellow: order UNDER_REVIEW
  Elsewhere: order CANCELING, or UNDER_REVIEW
  once the saga has been suspended
endlegend
@enduml
